WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.468 --> 00:00:02.409
Hello! [s@Hello!

2
00:00:02.509 --> 00:00:04.150
Who are you?

3
00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:06.452
I'm a sea lion.

4
00:00:06.552 --> 00:00:09.954
We are sea mammals.

5
00:00:09.995 --> 00:00:10.755
Where do you live?

6
00:00:29.052 --> 00:00:32.134
Most sea lions live near the Pacific Ocean.

7
00:00:34.095 --> 00:00:35.736
We live along the coast.

8
00:00:37.617 --> 00:00:39.578
We also live on islands.

9
00:00:41.819 --> 00:00:43.640
You look like a seal.

10
00:00:45.241 --> 00:00:47.042
We are different from seals.

11
00:00:48.363 --> 00:00:50.824
We can walk with our strong flippers.

12
00:00:52.205 --> 00:00:53.726
Seals can't do that.

13
00:00:55.707 --> 00:00:57.108
Are you a good swimmer?

14
00:00:58.448 --> 00:01:00.770
Yes. We are great swimmers.

15
00:01:02.131 --> 00:01:03.392
We're really fast.

16
00:01:05.033 --> 00:01:06.734
We can also dive deep.

17
00:01:09.115 --> 00:01:10.937
You have a lot of friends!

18
00:01:12.738 --> 00:01:14.839
Sea lions live in big groups.

19
00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:18.442
We lie in the sun together.

20
00:01:20.663 --> 00:01:22.725
And we bark very loudly.

21
00:01:26.487 --> 00:01:27.508
What do you eat?

22
00:01:29.832 --> 00:01:31.553
We eat lots of fish.

23
00:01:33.834 --> 00:01:36.375
We also like squid and shellfish.

24
00:01:38.296 --> 00:01:40.117
Do you have any enemies?

25
00:01:41.778 --> 00:01:43.298
Killer whales hunt us.

26
00:01:45.019 --> 00:01:46.920
Great white sharks hunt us too.

27
00:01:49.541 --> 00:01:50.922
I'm going to lie in the sun.

28
00:01:52.843 --> 00:01:53.623
See you later!

29
00:01:57.489 --> 00:01:59.000
Good-bye, Sea Lion!
